---
// Explainer: distinguish expenses within funds from a separate platform charge.
---
<figure class="fee-map" data-card="figure" aria-labelledby="fee-map-title">
  <figcaption id="fee-map-title"><strong>Inside the ETF, or paid to a platform?</strong></figcaption>
  <div class="fee-map-grid">
    <section aria-label="iFAST ETF expenses">
      <h3>iFAST ETF</h3>
      <div class="fee-map-box">
        <b>iFAST fund</b>
        <span>0.25% a year + running costs</span>
        <p>Holds an overseas fund:</p>
        <div class="fee-map-inner"><b>Xtrackers fund</b><span>Its own fund fee</span></div>
      </div>
      <p><strong>Both are fund expenses.</strong> They reduce the value of your investment. Our illustrative ETF totals include both; there is no separate iFAST platform fee in these totals.</p>
    </section>
    <section aria-label="Unit trust and platform charges">
      <h3>Unit trust on a platform</h3>
      <div class="fee-map-box"><b>Unit trust</b><span>Its own fund fee</span></div>
      <p class="fee-map-plus" aria-label="plus">+</p>
      <div class="fee-map-box"><b>Platform service</b><span>Separate charge: 0.35%–0.60% a year in the examples cited</span></div>
      <p><strong>The platform fee is extra.</strong> It pays for the service through which you hold the unit trust. It is not the iFAST ETF charge shown alongside.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
  <p class="fee-map-source">Fee structure, not a comparison of total costs. iFAST prospectus registered 29 September 2026; FSM Global and Endowus platform schedules read 13 October 2026. Platform charges depend on the account and service. The 0.10% combined Singapore running cost used in our examples is an assumption, not a published charge or cap. Individual expenses may each reach or exceed 0.10%. Actual total expenses are not yet available. Sources and links are in the verification fold.</p>
</figure>
<style>
  .fee-map{margin:24px 0;padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:10px;background:var(--color-surface);color:var(--color-body)}
  .fee-map figcaption{font-size:18px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--color-dark)}
  .fee-map-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:24px;margin-top:18px}
  .fee-map section{min-width:0}
  .fee-map h3{font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--color-dark)}
  .fee-map p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;margin:12px 0 0}
  .fee-map-box{border:1px solid var(--color-muted);border-radius:6px;padding:12px}
  .fee-map-box b,.fee-map-box span{display:block;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}
  .fee-map-box b{color:var(--color-dark)}
  .fee-map-inner{margin-top:10px;border-left:3px solid var(--color-muted);padding-left:12px}
  .fee-map .fee-map-plus{margin:4px 0;text-align:center;font-size:20px;color:var(--color-dark)}
  .fee-map .fee-map-source{font-size:13px;color:var(--color-muted);margin-top:18px}
  @media(max-width:640px){.fee-map-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:22px}}
</style>
